DESCRIPTION:Tickets Available Now\nAdults – $27\, Student – $14\, Children 
 under 18 – Free \nSunday\, Nov 1 2026\n4:15 pm pre-concert talk\n5:00 pm pe
 rformance\nBuskirk-Chumley Theater\nGeneral Admission \n\nAmerica is a tune
 . It must be sung together. – Gerald Stanley Lee\, Crowds: A Moving-Picture
  of Democracy\, 1913 \nOn Sunday\, November 1\, the Bloomington Symphony Or
 chestra will perform a concert in recognition of our country’s 250th year. 
 From the familiar square dance feel of Aaron Copland’s Hoedown to the soulf
 ul\, bluesy tonalities of William Grant Still’s Afro-American Symphony\, th
 is concert explores what it means to be an American. \nProgram:\n“Hoedown” 
 from Rodeo – Aaron Copland\n“In Memoriam Sojourner Truth” – Gary Powell Nas
 h\nAll Things Majestic – Jennifer Higdon\nSymphony No. 1 – Afro-American Sy
 mphony – William Grant Still \nI travel the world\, and I’m happy to say th
 at America is still the great melting pot – maybe a chunky stew rather than
  a melting pot at this point\, but you know what I mean. – Philip Glass\, 1
 999 NPR interview \n\n\n\n\n\nBSO Season Passes can be purchased through Oc
 tober 16th. Passes include discounted tickets to all 4 season concerts\, re
 served seating\, and other benefits. Learn more and purchase your Season Pa
 ss (CLICK HERE)\n\nTickets for this concert are available for purchase thro
 ugh the Buskirk-Chumley Theater Box Office online\, or call 812-323-3020 ex
 t 1\, or go to 114 E Kirkwood Ave.\n\n\n\n\n\nWe don’t want cost to be the 
 reason you don’t come to this concert. Thanks to our generous donors\, we h
 ave some tickets available to ensure that anybody who wants to attend our c
 oncerts can do so\, regardless of their current financial situation. If you
  will use a ticket\, we will do all we can to make you our guest. Fill out 
 THIS SHORT FORM and we will contact you when we have free tickets available
 .
LAST-MODIFIED:20260907T034627Z
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 E. Kirkwood Avenue\, Bloomington\, I
 N\, 47408\, United States
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:We the People - Concert at Buskirk-Chumley Theater
TRANSP:OPAQUE
