DESCRIPTION:Season passes for our 57th season can be purchased through Octo
 ber 16th. \nPurchase your Season Pass now for all 4 ticketed concerts of ou
 r 57th Season\, Full Steam Ahead\, to take advantage of these pass holder b
 enefits: \n\nUp to 20% off of individual ticket prices\nPreferred seating –
  our events are general seating\, but we will reserve your favorite seats j
 ust for you!\nSpecial events like house concerts and open rehearsals\nMeet 
 and greet with new music director\, Michael Patterson\nReceive a special 57
 th season collectors edition sticker\n\nPasses include tickets to the 4 tic
 keted concers at the Buskirk-Chumley Theater. For Celebrate the Season\, yo
 u have your choice between the 5pm or 8pm show. \n\n\n \nMusical Memories\n
 Sunday\, August 30\, 2026\, 7pm\, Switchyard Park\nEnjoy familiar classics 
 like Copland’s Rodeo\, Bizet’s Carmen Suite\, and more in this FREE family-
 friendly concert. \nWe the People\nSunday\, November 1\, 2026\, at 5pm\, Bu
 skirk-Chumley Theater\nJoin us in celebrating our nation’s 250th birthday w
 ith works by William Grant Still and other American composers. \nCelebrate 
 the Season\nFriday\, November 27\, 2026\, at 5pm or 8pm\, Buskirk-Chumley T
 heater\nTuesday\, December 8\, 2026\, at 7pm\, Tivoli Theatre in Spencer\nM
 usic from the Movies is the theme of this year’s festive holiday celebratio
 n.Chose from the 5pm or 8pm show\, before or after enjoying Bloomington’s C
 anopy of Lights. \nSome Assembly Required\nSunday\, March 7\, 2027\, at 5pm
 \, Buskirk-Chumley Theater\nWe’re collecting bits from YOUR favorite sympho
 nies to create a one-of-a-kind performance\, including collaboration with B
 ridges Youth Orchestra.\, and featuring this year’s BSO Youth Concerto Come
 ptition winner. \nLarger than Life\nSunday\, May 16\, 2027\, at 5pm\, Buski
 rk-Chumley Theater\nA season finale of EPIC proportions\, featuring a colla
 boration with Salaam\, as well as Mahler’s remarkable Symphony No 1. \nClic
 k here to purchase your season pass\, or use the form below.
